Lore_10 =
"\cU[Introduction]\n\n"
"In a universe where every single strand of its existence is besieged by the arrival of a new ontological standard, things that are never meant to be "
"seen or understood in any layer other than the abstract (or conceptual), are made manifest in other layers of existence.";

Lore_11 =
"\cU[Chapter I - Psykhus]\n\n"
"What happens to consciousness after death remains one of humanity's greatest mysteries. Some suggest that logically, our mind simply ceases to be. "
"We return back to the universe through decomposition, becoming a part of the soil and air, feeding into the life of an ecosystem once again. "
"Others believe that only in death does true consciousness emerge because it is no longer bound by biological and sensory feedbacks.";

Lore_12 =
"\cU[Chapter I - Psykhus]\n\n"
"Alas, what we recently discovered from field studies has shed some light on the age-old question. Analyses of bodies recovered from The Perimeter reveal a "
"phenomenon that manifests when enough parts of the deceased's existence are removed.";

Lore_13 =
"\cU[Chapter I - Psykhus]\n\n"
"This phenomenon induces a psychoactive effect on any sentient beings that are within its proximity. Those affected in the majority of cases "
"experience a ''dual-consciousness'', constantly reliving the last moments of the dying person, and have to be manually moved away to sever this effect. "
"It's for this reason that we've termed the phenomenon ''Psykhus''.";

Lore_14 =
"\cU[Chapter I - Psykhus]\n\n"
"What I uncovered from observations and experimental researches into Psykhus, I still struggle to put into words. Its properties are extremely perplexing, "
"and findings are still limited due to the perilous nature of its observation site. I can only explain it as the final ''breath'' "
"from a part of our universe manifesting, left orphaned where it cannot undergo the process of natural decay to maintain the laws of thermodynamics.";

Lore_15 =
"\cU[Chapter I - Psykhus]\n\n"
"The others believe that the strength of the manifestation is directly linked to the reach an aberrant mutation has within a mutated physical body. They hypothesized that this hybrid energy then "
"becomes ripe for the taking by any entities capable of consuming it. [End of excerpt]";

